---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="badge">AI-Powered Team Execution</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      회의는 끝났는데,<br />
      정리는 누가 하죠?
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      AI가 회의를 요약하고, 블로커를 감지하고, 이번 주 할 일을 정리합니다.<br />
      5명이든 15명이든 — 실행에만 집중하세요.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary">무료로 시작하기</a>
      <a href="#features" class="btn btn-outline">기능 살펴보기</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">카드 등록 없음 &middot; 3분이면 팀 세팅 완료</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 160px 0 96px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 120px 0 64px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }

    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
    }
  }
</style>
